# Outfit camera (R18): a cine camera: boxy body, two big accent film reels standing on top (the magazine, the
# classic movie-camera silhouette), a long steel lens barrel ending in an open matte box with barn-door flaps, a
# viewfinder eyepiece at the back, a steel top handle and a glowing tally light.
name outfit_cinecam
grid 5
size 12 5 11
slot body Ink
slot lens Steel
slot reel SwatchAccent
slot tally SwatchGlow
box 1 0 0 7 5 4 body
box 0 1 2 1 4 4 lens
beam 7 2.5 2 9 2.5 2 1.2 lens
box 9 0 0 11 5 4 body
carve box 9 1 1 11 4 3
box 11 0 4 12 5 5 body
ellipsoid 2.2 2.5 7.4 2.2 1 2.2 reel
ellipsoid 6.2 2.5 6.8 1.8 1 1.8 reel
carve ellipsoid 2.2 2.5 7.4 0.6 1 0.6
carve ellipsoid 6.2 2.5 6.8 0.5 1 0.5
box 3 2 4 6 3 5 lens
box 6 0 3 7 1 4 tally
pivot 4 2 0
